theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0.607843, 0.564706, 0.6, 1)
text = "选择 ROOM_WORLD 从序章进入完整房间网络：A0-A13 主区域与 H01-H08 隐藏区域，共 50 个房间规格。场景出口由宏观连接图生成；地形碰撞、路线门槛与出生点仍需在 Godot 运行时逐项验收。测试模式不覆盖正式存档。\nEnter ROOM_WORLD to explore the complete room network: A0-A13 plus H01-H08, 50 room contracts. Scene exits are driven by the world graph; collision, route gates and spawn safety still require Godot runtime acceptance. Normal saves are protected.\n操作：方向键/A-D 移动，Space 跳跃，E 交互，F6 返回本选择页。"
